            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <div class="step-card">
                    <div class="step-number">02</div>
                    <h4 class="step-title">Scoutix Finds Your Prospects</h4>
                    <p class="step-description">
                        Our intelligence engine discovers verified businesses and streams them straight into your pipeline — with full contact details, in minutes.
                    </p>
